Optional sidecar: CLIProxyAPI
-----------------------------

ApiCluster's "CLI 边车" feature can launch an external executable named
`CLIProxyAPI.exe` as a child process in order to wrap subscription accounts
(Claude Code / Codex / Antigravity / Grok / Kimi) as an OpenAI-compatible API.

That binary is NOT part of this repository and is NOT redistributed here.
It is built from the upstream open-source project:

    CLIProxyAPI
    https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI
    Copyright (c) 2025- Luis Pater
    Copyright (c) 2025- present Router-For.ME
    Released under the MIT License.

ApiCluster only generates its configuration file and manages the child process
lifecycle. All credentials handled by CLIProxyAPI are stored under the local
data directory (%USERPROFILE%\.ApiCluster\cliproxy\auths by default) and never
leave your machine.

To use this feature, download or build CLIProxyAPI yourself and place it next
to ApiCluster.exe as `CLIProxyAPI.exe`.
